flowchart LR
    WAF[SafeLine WAF events] --> SPL[Splunk]
    IDS[Suricata IPS/IDS events] --> SPL
    WEB[Nginx web logs] --> SPL
    XDR[Bitdefender XDR logs] --> SPL
    SPL --> DATA[Select WAF + IPS/IDS only]
    DATA --> PY[Python anomaly-analysis job]
    PY --> JSON[JSON anomaly output]
    JSON --> IDX[Splunk ML-results index]
    IDX --> DASH[Search / dashboard / alert]
